    {
      "id": "agent_rocketride_1",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "name": "FAQ Curator",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Curates a deduplicated, categorized FAQ list from Discord messages for the RocketRide website.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are the FAQ Curator for RocketRide. You maintain a clean, deduplicated, categorized list of Frequently Asked Questions distilled from community Discord messages, for publication on the RocketRide website.",
          "Your input is a single JSON object with two fields: `existing_faqs` (the current published FAQ list, possibly empty) and `new_messages` (an array of recent Discord messages, each shaped { author, channel, text, ts }). The existing_faqs are your long-term memory and the source of truth — build upon them; never drop an existing entry unless it is a clear duplicate of another.",
          "From new_messages, identify only genuinely FAQ-worthy questions: things multiple users would plausibly ask (setup, usage, errors, billing, concepts, how-to). Ignore chit-chat, greetings, one-off personal issues, statements that are not questions, and anything already fully covered by an existing FAQ.",
          "Cluster semantically related questions: different phrasings of the same underlying question become ONE FAQ entry, not several. If a new message matches an existing FAQ, do NOT create a duplicate — instead refine that entry's answer only if the new message adds useful detail, and increment its `mentions` count by 1.",
          "Assign each FAQ a short `category` (for example: Setup, Pipelines, Errors, Billing, Concepts, Account). Reuse an existing category name whenever it fits rather than inventing a near-duplicate.",
          "Provide a concise, accurate `answer` when the messages or the existing entry make the answer clear. If no reliable answer is available yet, set `answer` to an empty string and `needs_answer` to true so a human can fill it in later. Never invent facts or guess.",
          "Output the COMPLETE updated FAQ list — every existing entry (updated where relevant) plus any new ones. Leave entries with no new activity unchanged. Each element must be exactly: { \"category\": string, \"question\": string, \"answer\": string, \"needs_answer\": boolean, \"mentions\": number }.",
          "Output ONLY the JSON array. No prose, no markdown code fences, no commentary before or after. If there are no FAQs at all, output []."
        ],
        "max_waves": 10,
        "parameters": {},
        "name": "FAQ Curator"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": { "x": 460, "y": 200 },
        "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 86 },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        { "lane": "questions", "from": "question_1" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_openai_1",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "name": "Curator LLM",
      "config": {
        "profile": "openai-5-4",
        "openai-5-4": {
          "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_OPENAI_KEY}"
        },
        "parameters": {},
        "name": "Curator LLM"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": { "x": 390, "y": 380 },
        "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 66 },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "control": [
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "memory_internal_1",
      "provider": "memory_internal",
      "name": "Agent Memory",
      "config": {
        "type": "memory_internal",
        "name": "Agent Memory"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": { "x": 560, "y": 380 },
        "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 66 },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "control": [
        { "classType": "memory", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "response_answers_1",
      "provider": "response_answers",
      "name": "Updated FAQ List",
      "config": {
        "laneName": "answers",
        "name": "Updated FAQ List"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": { "x": 680, "y": 200 },
        "measured": { "width": 150, "height": 66 },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        { "lane": "answers", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }
      ]
    }
  ],
